Release Rust SDK 0.3.0 with an experimental lock provider codec

Adds the sophia-lock-protocol crate, a codec with no client, and
Pipeline::write_secret with its zeroing guarantees in sophia-9p-client.
The release also carries the WM contract documents imported since 0.2.0.
Every spec copy is byte-identical at Sophia's signed master merge
61d545c90 (t294). The lock contract still marks itself revision 1 (draft),
so the lock codec is experimental until Sophia accepts it explicitly.

No public item was removed or changed. Pipeline gains a Drop impl, but its
fields are private.
